config.body:
Hi {{variables.ownerName}},

You have a new collaborator application for {{variables.projectName}}!

---

**Candidate Details**

**Name:** {{trigger.data.name}}
**Email:** {{trigger.data.email}}
**Location:** {{trigger.data.location || 'Not provided'}}
**Submitted via:** {{format_lane.submissionType}}

---

**Interest Area:** {{format_lane.laneName}}
**Availability:** {{format_lane.availabilityText}}
**Work Preference:** {{trigger.data.workPreference ? trigger.data.workPreference.join(', ') : 'Not specified'}}

---

**Links to Work:**
{{trigger.data.workLinks || 'Not provided'}}

---

**What they've shipped:**
{{trigger.data.shipped}}

---

**Why they're interested:**
{{trigger.data.whyNetpad}}

---

**Additional comments:**
{{trigger.data.anythingElse || 'None'}}

---

Reply directly to {{trigger.data.email}} if you'd like to set up a call.

Best,
Your Collaborator Recruitment Workflow
